WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Keep the four beds where they are. Move each family to a different bed every year.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In year one, cabbage grows in the first bed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In year two, move cabbage to a new bed. Carrots take its old place.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In year three, beans take the first bed. The other families move too.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
In year four, onions take the first bed.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The first bed had four different families in four years. Then the cycle can start again.
